#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:62
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Shows are rated higher than movies: the typical show scores ★ "
"<strong>%(show)s</strong> against ★ <strong>%(movie)s</strong> for a movie, "
"%(gap)s points apart."
msgstr ""
"Seriallar filmlardan yuqoriroq baholanadi: odatiy serial ★ <strong>%(show)s</"
"strong> oladi, film esa ★ <strong>%(movie)s</strong>, farq — %(gap)s ball."

#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:63
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Movies are rated higher than shows: the typical movie scores ★ "
"<strong>%(movie)s</strong> against ★ <strong>%(show)s</strong> for a show, "
"%(gap)s points apart."
msgstr ""
"Filmlar seriallardan yuqoriroq baholanadi: odatiy film ★ <strong>%(movie)s</"
"strong> oladi, serial esa ★ <strong>%(show)s</strong>, farq — %(gap)s ball."

#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:64
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Movies and shows are rated about the same: ★ <strong>%(movie)s</strong> for "
"the typical movie, ★ <strong>%(show)s</strong> for the typical show."
msgstr ""
"Filmlar va seriallar taxminan bir xil baholanadi: odatiy film uchun ★ "
"<strong>%(movie)s</strong>, odatiy serial uchun ★ <strong>%(show)s</strong>."

