#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:139
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>%(over)s%%</strong> of movies with a known budget returned five "
"times it or more; only <strong>%(under)s%%</strong> earned less than they "
"cost."
msgstr ""
"Byudjeti maʼlum filmlarning <strong>%(over)s%%</strong> qismi uni besh "
"baravar yoki undan koʻp qaytargan; atigi <strong>%(under)s%%</strong> "
"sarflanganidan kam topgan."

#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:142
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Based on %(counter)s movie with a known budget of at least $1M and box-"
"office revenue. Not adjusted for inflation; streaming releases and movies "
"still in cinemas can read low."
msgid_plural ""
"Based on %(counter)s movies with a known budget of at least $1M and box-"
"office revenue. Not adjusted for inflation; streaming releases and movies "
"still in cinemas can read low."
msgstr[0] ""
"Byudjeti kamida $1 mln boʻlgan va kassa tushumi maʼlum boʻlgan %(counter)s "
"ta filmga asoslangan. Inflyatsiyaga tuzatishsiz; striming relizlari va hali "
"kinoteatrlarda namoyish etilayotgan filmlar past koʻrinishi mumkin."

#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:150
