msgstr "Har bir filmning byudjeti va daromadi, nuqtali diagramma"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:156
msgid ""
"Each point is a movie. Above the lower dashed line it earned more than it "
"cost; above the upper one, five times as much. Select a point to open the "
"movie."
msgstr ""
"Har bir nuqta — bitta film. Pastki punktir chiziqdan yuqorida u "
"sarflanganidan koʻproq topgan; yuqoridagisidan yuqorida — besh baravar koʻp. "
"Filmni ochish uchun nuqtani tanlang."

#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:161
msgid "Return on budget by genre"
msgstr "Janrlar boʻyicha byudjet qaytimi"

#: analytics/templates/analytics/dashboard.html:162
